{
  "source": "videos/opener-understand-v2.mp4",
  "duration": 154.6026875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 5.38,
      "text": "It's not magic, it's not a person, and it's definitely not normal software."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.88,
      "end": 11.08,
      "text": "It is entirely its own kind of thing, operating by a completely different set of rules."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.8,
      "end": 17.54,
      "text": "Sometimes working with AI feels like you have a PhD expert sitting right beside you, handing"
    },
    {
      "start": 17.54,
      "end": 19.42,
      "text": "you brilliant insights in seconds."
    },
    {
      "start": 19.98,
      "end": 25.06,
      "text": "Other times, it makes the kind of glaring, illogical mistake you'd expect from a six-year-old."
    },
    {
      "start": 25.06,
      "end": 29.1,
      "text": "How can the exact same tool operate at both of those extremes?"
    },
    {
      "start": 30.8,
      "end": 35.18,
      "text": "Understanding what actually happens underneath explains why it behaves the way it does."
    },
    {
      "start": 36.74,
      "end": 37.82,
      "text": "Think about driving a car."
    },
    {
      "start": 38.38,
      "end": 42.8,
      "text": "You can get perfectly good at it without ever opening the hood to look at the engine, but"
    },
    {
      "start": 42.8,
      "end": 46.4,
      "text": "if you don't know what's happening in there, you won't fully grasp what the vehicle"
    },
    {
      "start": 46.4,
      "end": 49.86,
      "text": "can handle or diagnose why it suddenly stalls on the highway."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.58,
      "end": 52.3,
      "text": "The same goes for artificial intelligence."
    },
    {
      "start": 52.98,
      "end": 57.94,
      "text": "Learning what's happening under the hood gives you a clearer picture of its actual capabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 58.76,
      "end": 64.02,
      "text": "Knowing how it works helps you use it thoughtfully, ensuring you remain smarter than the tool"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.02,
      "end": 64.72,
      "text": "you're operating."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.24,
      "end": 71.08,
      "text": "We are going to take you inside the machine, but you don't need to memorize a dictionary"
    },
    {
      "start": 71.08,
      "end": 72.22,
      "text": "of technical terms."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.78,
      "end": 77.92,
      "text": "Our single goal here is to help you understand a specific transformation—how the words"
    },
    {
      "start": 77.92,
      "end": 80.36,
      "text": "you type turn into the answer you receive."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.44,
      "end": 84.5,
      "text": "This roadmap shows what we'll explore in this section."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.1,
      "end": 90.7,
      "text": "To be clear, the numbers on this map represent our order of learning, not a five-step sequence"
    },
    {
      "start": 90.7,
      "end": 93.2,
      "text": "the AI runs through every time you send a message."
    },
    {
      "start": 93.8,
      "end": 95.76,
      "text": "We'll start with how AI learned."
    },
    {
      "start": 96.3,
      "end": 100.76,
      "text": "Looking at how initial training builds the patterns the system relies on to answer you."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.3,
      "end": 106.14,
      "text": "Second is why probability matters, where we see how the information the AI possesses"
    },
    {
      "start": 106.14,
      "end": 109.0,
      "text": "dictates what word is most likely to come next."
    },
    {
      "start": 109.42,
      "end": 111.48,
      "text": "Third, how words become numbers."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.2,
      "end": 117.14,
      "text": "We'll break down how text is chopped into smaller pieces called tokens, and how those"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.14,
      "end": 119.76,
      "text": "tokens are assigned numbers representing their meaning."
    },
    {
      "start": 120.84,
      "end": 122.78,
      "text": "Fourth is how meaning takes shape."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.32,
      "end": 127.84,
      "text": "Here we'll see how words influence each other, altering their assigned numbers and"
    },
    {
      "start": 127.84,
      "end": 129.1,
      "text": "mathematical relationships."
    },
    {
      "start": 130.24,
      "end": 133.48,
      "text": "Finally, how AI builds an answer ties it all together."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.04,
      "end": 138.92,
      "text": "We look at the final construction process, why the answers vary, and just how much math"
    },
    {
      "start": 138.92,
      "end": 139.68,
      "text": "goes into it."
    },
    {
      "start": 141.16,
      "end": 145.18,
      "text": "As you move through the course, you'll see that each topic builds directly on the one"
    },
    {
      "start": 145.18,
      "end": 145.72,
      "text": "before it."
    },
    {
      "start": 147.04,
      "end": 148.94,
      "text": "The machine won't feel like magic anymore."
    },
    {
      "start": 149.74,
      "end": 150.8,
      "text": "Take it a piece at a time."
    }
  ],
